flowchart TD
    Reported([A workload is not running the expected version]):::situation --> Trace
    Trace($ flux trace -n NS deploy NAME):::cmd

    Trace --> Owned{Managed by}:::choice

    NotReady([A Flux object is not Ready]):::situation
    NotReady ~~~ Owned

    Owned -->|Kustomization| FailingObject{Last failing<br>block}:::choice
    Owned -->|HelmRelease| TraceHelmRelease($ flux trace -n NS helmrelease NAME):::cmd --> FailingObject
    Owned -->|not managed| Unmanaged[Add it to spec.path, or find the tool that applied it]

    FailingObject -->|none| CheckRevision[Compare the applied revision with Git]

    CheckRevision --> Matches{Matches?}:::choice
    Matches -->|no| NotAdvancing([The Flux object is Ready but stuck on an old revision]):::situation --> FluxGet($ flux get KIND NAME -A):::cmd

    FluxGet --> Suspended{Suspended?}:::choice
    Suspended -->|no| FluxCheck($ flux check):::cmd --> FluxUnhealthy{Problems?}:::choice
    Suspended -->|yes| Resume($ flux resume -n NS KIND NAME):::cmd

    Resume ~~~ FluxUnhealthy

    FluxUnhealthy -->|no| NoSyncTriggered([Nothing has triggered a sync yet]):::situation --> ReconcileStale($ flux reconcile -n NS kustomization NAME --with-source):::cmd
    FluxUnhealthy -->|yes| FluxLogs($ flux logs -A --level=error):::cmd

    FailingObject -->|"source (Git/OCI/Bucket/Helm)"| FixSource["Fix the URL, ref or credentials (see Message)"] --> ReconcileSource($ flux reconcile -n NS source TYPE NAME):::cmd

    FailingObject -->|Kustomization/HelmRelease| GetEvents($ flux events -n NS --for KIND/NAME):::cmd

    Matches -->|yes| Reconciled([Flux reports everything as reconciled]):::situation --> DiffKustomization($ flux diff -n NS kustomization NAME --path ./PATH):::cmd --> Changes{Changes?}:::choice
    Changes -->|yes| NotApplied([Flux is not applying this object]):::situation --> CheckKustomization[Check spec.path and kustomization.yaml]
    Changes -->|no| CheckPodIssues:::ref@{ shape: doc, label: "Troubleshoot workloads" }

    NotReady --> GetEvents
    GetEvents --> Reason{Reason}:::choice
    Reason -->|RetriesExhausted| FixHelmRelease[Fix the HelmRelease in Git]
    FixHelmRelease --> ReconcileHelmKustomization("$ flux reconcile -n NS kustomization NAME --with-source"):::cmd --> ReconcileHelmRelease("$ flux reconcile -n NS helmrelease NAME --reset"):::cmd

    Reason -->|HealthCheckFailed| CheckPodIssues
    Reason -->|DependencyNotReady| DependencyNotReady[Start again at the dependency]

    DependencyNotReady ~~~ CheckMessage

    Reason -->|other| CheckMessage[Check the Message column] --> Rollout{Waiting on<br>workload?}:::choice
    Rollout -->|no| FixIssue[Fix in Git] --> Reconcile($ flux reconcile -n NS kustomization NAME --with-source):::cmd
    Rollout -->|yes| CheckPodIssues

    FailingObject -->|HelmChart| FixChart[Fix spec.chart in the HelmRelease in Git] --> ReconcileChart($ flux reconcile -n NS kustomization NAME --with-source):::cmd
